===
# Reveal.js Auto-animate

::: {.fragment .fade-up}
Content that fades up
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-down}
Content that fades down
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-left}
Content that fades from left
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-right}
Content that fades from right
:::

===
# Reveal.js Grow/Shrink

::: {.fragment .grow}
This will grow
:::

::: {.fragment .shrink}
This will shrink
:::

===
# Class for Container Styling

::: {.container; max-width: '800px'; margin: '0 auto'; background: '#ecf0f1'; padding: '30px'; border-radius: '10px'}
### Centered Container
Content in a max-width container

This pattern is useful for limiting content width on large screens
:::

===
# Class + Full Abstractions

::: {.demo-box .featured; rotate: -2; scale: 1.05; transparency: 10; columns: 2; gap: 25; background: '#34495e'; color: 'white'; padding: '30px'; border-radius: '12px'}
### Left Side
All features combined:
- Classes
- Transforms
- Layout
- Transparency

### Right Side
This demonstrates the full power of the abstraction system
:::

===
# Practical: Alert Box

::: {.alert .alert-info; background: '#d1ecf1'; color: '#0c5460'; padding: '20px'; border: '1px solid #bee5eb'; border-radius: '5px'; border-left: '5px solid #17a2b8'}
**Info:** This is an informational alert box
:::

::: {.alert .alert-warning; background: '#fff3cd'; color: '#856404'; padding: '20px'; border: '1px solid #ffeaa7'; border-radius: '5px'; border-left: '5px solid #ffc107'}
**Warning:** This is a warning alert box
:::

::: {.alert .alert-danger; background: '#f8d7da'; color: '#721c24'; padding: '20px'; border: '1px solid #f5c6cb'; border-radius: '5px'; border-left: '5px solid #dc3545'}
**Error:** This is an error alert box
:::

===
# End

Classes provide flexibility for:
- Reveal.js animations
- Custom CSS styling
- Semantic markup
- Reusable components
